OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Frather cloudy for many, however, a
OL,7,Fslight frost may form under clear
OL,8,Fspells inland through the middle of
OL,9,Fthe night, with the odd light shower
OL,10,Fnear coasts. Cloudier with patchy rain
OL,11,Fin far north by dawn. Light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA band of cloud and showery
OL,14,Frain should move slowly southwards,
OL,15,Fmainly affecting coastal districts
OL,16,Fbefore brightening up generally later.
OL,17,FTemperatures near normal, but turning
OL,18,Fcolder into the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
