OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FTurning brighter, clearer and colder
OL,7,Ffor a time from Thursday, with sunny
OL,8,Fperiods but also a cold wind and sharp
OL,9,Fovernight frosts. Slowly turning
OL,10,Fcloudier and less cold through
OL,11,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
